ability company in Nigeria, the main business focus of forthouse is to facilitate trading and provide marine logistics in the oil and gas industry. Our new areas of focus are offshore equipment and energy technology.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eForthouse has been strategically positioned to deliver a sustainable competitive advantage that will efficiently satisfy clients and business partners globally, having access to and partnerships with key players and government agencies in the petroleum and gas sector worldwide.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn fulfilling our vision, we shall further engage new partnerships and continually align with emerging changes and reforms in the sector for more efficient service.\",\"headingAlign\":\"left\",\"headingAlignTablet\":\"left\",\"headingAlignMobile\":\"left\",\"headingColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-2)\",\"subHeadingColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-3)\",\"prefixColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-8)\",\"prefixTransform\":\"uppercase\",\"headSpace\":20,\"subHeadSpace\":0,\"seperatorSpace\":20,\"block_id\":\"4960c374\",\"showCtaIcon\":false,\"ctaIcon\":\"\",\"seperatorPosition\":\"after_icon\",\"seperatorColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-0)\",\"seperatorWidth\":80,\"separatorWidthType\":\"px\",\"seperatorThickness\":4,\"ctaText\":\"Learn More\",\"ctaLinkColor\":\"\",\"ctaTransform\":\"\",\"ctaLineHeight\":1,\"ctaBtnLinkColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-2)\",\"ctaLinkHoverColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-5)\",\"ctaBgColor\":\"#ffffff00\",\"ctaBgHoverColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-0)\",\"ctaBorderColor\":\"\",\"ctaBorderStyle\":\"\",\"showIcon\":false,\"paddingBtnTop\":16,\"paddingBtnBottom\":16,\"paddingBtnLeft\":20,\"paddingBtnRight\":20,\"prefixTopMargin\":0,\"prefixRightMargin\":0,\"prefixSpace\":20,\"prefixLeftMargin\":0,\"prefixLetterSpacing\":2,\"headTopMargin\":0,\"headRightMargin\":0,\"headLeftMargin\":0,\"headMarginTopTablet\":0,\"head