d gas industry. Our new areas of focus are offshore equipment and energy technology.<br><br>Forthouse has been strategically positioned to deliver a sustainable competitive advantage that will efficiently satisfy clients and business partners globally, having access to and partnerships with key players and government agencies in the petroleum and gas sector worldwide.<br><br>In fulfilling our vision, we shall further engage new partnerships and continually align with emerging changes and reforms in the sector for more efficient service.</p></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/info-box --></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container --></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/container {\"block_id\":\"cc344175\",\"alignItemsDesktop\":\"stretch\",\"alignItemsTablet\":\"stretch\",\"alignItemsMobile\":\"stretch\",\"backgroundType\":\"color\",\"backgroundColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-4)\",\"topPaddingDesktop\":100,\"bottomPaddingDesktop\":100,\"leftPaddingDesktop\":40,\"rightPaddingDesktop\":40,\"topPaddingTablet\":80,\"bottomPaddingTablet\":80,\"leftPaddingTablet\":32,\"rightPaddingTablet\":32,\"topPaddingMobile\":64,\"bottomPaddingMobile\":64,\"leftPaddingMobile\":24,\"rightPaddingMobile\":24,\"paddingLink\":false,\"topMarginTablet\":0,\"bottomMarginTablet\":0,\"leftMarginTablet\":0,\"rightMarginTablet\":0,\"topMarginMobile\":0,\"bottomMarginMobile\":0,\"leftMarginMobile\":0,\"rightMarginMobile\":0,\"variationSelected\":true,\"rowGapTablet\":50,\"rowGapMobile\":40,\"columnGapTablet\":0,\"columnGapMobile\":0,\"isBlockRootParent\":true,\"equalHeight\":true} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-cc344175 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\"><!-- wp:uagb/advanced-heading {\"block_id\":\"7b2294a3\",\"classMigrate\":true,\"headingDescToggle\":true,\"headingAlign\":\"center\",\"headingAlignTablet\":\"center\",\"headingAlignMobile\":\"center\",\"subHeadingColor\":\"\",\"he