e-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">The Story Behind Forthouse Reserve Alliance</h2></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Our fleet of vessels, operated by an experienced crew, is designed to meet the unique demands of the upstream and downstream sectors of the oil and gas industry. We specialize in the shipping of crude oil, refined products and natural gas to and from key energy hubs worldwide, as well as the installation and maintenance of green energy systems, all of which are tailored to meet our clients\' specific needs.<br><br>Our team of experts works closely with clients to understand their unique requirements and develop customized solutions that optimize their supply chains, reduce costs and improve operational efficiency.</p><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a href=\"about/\" class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" onclick=\"return true;\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Learn More</span></a></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/info-box --></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/container {\"block_id\":\"b9774670\",\"innerContentCustomWidthDesktop\":780,\"backgroundType\":\"image\",\"backgroundImageDesktop\":{\"id\":1606,\"title\":\"10\",\"filename\":\"10.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://forthouse-reserve.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/10.jpg\",\"link\":\"https://forthouse-reserve.com/10/\",\"alt\":\"10\",\"author\":\"0\",\"description\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"name\":\"10\",\"status\":\"inherit\",\"uploadedTo\":0,\"date\":1734625050000,\"modified\":1734625050000,\"menuOrder\":0,\"mime\":\"image/jpeg\",\"type\":\"image\",\"subtype\":\"jpeg\",\"icon\":\"https://forthouse-reserve.com/wp-includes/images/media/default.svg\",\"dateFormatted\":\"19 December 2024\",\"nonces\":{\"update\":false,\"delete\":false,\"edit\":false},\"editLink\":false